		],
	},
	{
		year: '2025',
		title: 'Graduation',
		body: [
			"Officially graduated with a Bachelor's in Informatics from Universitas Muria Kudus. Juggling my thesis and a full-time dev job was a major flex, tbh. We made it out of the trenches!",
		],
	},
	{
		year: '2024',
		title: 'Full Time at BBO',
		body: [
			"Secured the full-time bag as a Software Engineer at BBO. Went from a part-time student to owning backend features, payment microservices, and speed-running query optimizations. Huge glow up, no cap.",
		],
	},
	{
		year: '2023',
		title: 'Bangkit Academy',
		body: [
			"Got accepted into Bangkit Academy's software engineering path. Was locked in the whole program learning production-ready system designs, cloud systems, and building with awesome folks. Core memory unlocked.",
		],
	},
	{
		year: '2022',
		title: 'Working Student',
		body: [
			"Began my dev era at Esoffplay as a part-time backend dev while in my sophomore year. Juggling uni classes and coding production databases was lowkey stressful but we cooked.",
		],
	},
	{
		year: '2021',
		title: 'Entering University',
		body: [
			"Started my higher education era at Universitas Muria Kudus majoring in Informatics. Finally started learning computer science for real instead of just copying code from YouTube tutorials.",
		],
	},
	{
		year: '2020',
		title: 'The Pandemic Spark',
		body: [
			"The pandemic hit and I was bored out of my mind. Decided to start my coding villain arc—teaching myself HTML, CSS, and JS every single day. Just pure grinding, no distractions.",
		],
	},
	{
		year: '2019',
		title: 'High School Era',
		body: [
			"Back in high school at SMK Permata Nusantara. Zero coding knowledge, no idea what a server was, just vibes and gaming. Coding wasn't even on my radar, fr.",
		],
